sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant API as ModelMeshApi<br/>8033/TCP gRPC<br/>Optional TLS/mTLS
    participant Cache as SidecarModelMesh<br/>LRU Cache
    participant Runtime as Model Runtime<br/>8085/TCP gRPC<br/>Plaintext (localhost)
    participant Litelinks as Litelinks<br/>8080/TCP Thrift<br/>Optional TLS
    participant RemoteMM as Remote ModelMesh Pod
    participant RemoteRT as Remote Runtime
    participant etcd as etcd Cluster<br/>2379/TCP gRPC<br/>Optional TLS

    Note over Client,etcd: Flow 1: Model Inference (Cache Hit - Local)
    Client->>API: gRPC inference request<br/>model-id in header/protobuf
    API->>Cache: Local cache lookup<br/>(in-process method call)
    Cache->>Runtime: Forward inference (ProtoSplicer)<br/>gRPC/8085 Plaintext
    Runtime-->>Cache: Prediction result
    Cache-->>API: Response
    API-->>Client: gRPC response

    Note over Client,etcd: Flow 1b: Model Inference (Cache Miss - Remote)
    Client->>API: gRPC inference request
    API->>Cache: Local cache lookup<br/>(model not loaded locally)
    Cache->>Litelinks: Route to remote instance<br/>Thrift RPC/8080
    Litelinks->>RemoteMM: Serialized request<br/>Optional TLS/mTLS
    RemoteMM->>RemoteRT: Forward inference<br/>gRPC/8085 Plaintext
    RemoteRT-->>RemoteMM: Prediction result
    RemoteMM-->>Litelinks: Serialized response
    Litelinks-->>Cache: Deserialized response
    Cache-->>API: Response
    API-->>Client: gRPC response

    Note over Client,etcd: Flow 2: Model Registration & Loading
    Client->>API: registerModel RPC<br/>gRPC/8033
    API->>Cache: Register model
    Cache->>etcd: Write model record<br/>gRPC/2379 (etcd v3 API)
    etcd-->>Cache: Confirm write
    Cache->>Runtime: loadModel RPC<br/>gRPC/8085 Plaintext
    Runtime-->>Cache: Load complete + model size
    Cache->>etcd: Update model status<br/>gRPC/2379
    etcd-->>Cache: Confirm update
    Cache-->>API: Registration result
    API-->>Client: Success response

    Note over Client,etcd: Flow 3: Prometheus Metrics Scraping
    participant Prom as Prometheus Scraper
    Prom->>API: GET /metrics<br/>HTTPS/2112<br/>TLS (self-signed cert)
    API-->>Prom: Metrics response<br/>(latency, cache stats, capacity)
